    <sys:String x:Key="Set.Group.AppDesc">Language preferences and SmoothFrame background engine status</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set.Timer.Title">High-precision OS timer (0.5 ms)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set.Timer.Desc">Lowers mouse and keyboard input latency by maximizing system timer frequency.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set.Power.Title">"High performance" power plan</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set.Power.Desc">Maintains peak CPU frequency and disables core parking during gaming sessions.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set.Cores.Title">P-core isolation</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set.Cores.Desc">Dedicating high-performance CPU cores exclusively to the active game process.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set.Bg.Title">Background app suppression</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set.Bg.Desc">Throttles browsers, Discord and background apps to eliminate frame drops.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set.Network.Title">Low-latency network (Zero-Ping)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set.Network.Desc">Disables Windows multimedia network packet throttling and enables TCP NoDelay (Nagle bypass).</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set.Io.Title">Disk I/O streaming acceleration</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set.Io.Desc">Assigns High I/O priority to the active game and Low I/O to background apps to stop asset stutters.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set.Audio.Title">Audio latency &amp; DPC isolation</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set.Audio.Desc">Pins Windows Audio Isolation (audiodg.exe) to a dedicated core to prevent audio dropouts and DPC spikes.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set.AutoBoost.Title">Automatic boost on game launch</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set.AutoBoost.Desc">Automatically activates optimization when a recognized game process starts.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set.Hotkey.Title">Global hotkey (Ctrl+Shift+B)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set.Hotkey.Desc">Instantly toggle optimization on or off directly in-game without alt-tabbing.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set.Autostart.Title">Start automatically with Windows</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set.Autostart.Desc">Launches SmoothFrame at system boot with administrator rights and no UAC prompts.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set.Tray.Title">Minimize to system tray on close</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set.Tray.Desc">Keeps optimizations active in the notification area when closing the window.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set.Lang.Title">Interface language</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set.Lang.Desc">Instant language switching across the entire application (English / Russian).</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set.Engine.Title">SmoothFrame Engine Service v2.1.1 Pro</sys:String>
